* 2026-09-18: Version 0.2.3
  - Critical bug and security vulnerability fixes (segfault in 'd', heap underflow in BCD, heap overflow on large writes, off-by-one over-read)
  - Fixed exit code inversion and added standard '-h' help option
  - Modernized C codebase: removed deprecated 'register' keywords, fixed compiler warnings
  - Performance: SIMD-accelerated pattern search using memchr/memcmp
  - Modernized Autotools build system and added automated test suite ('make check')
  - Comprehensive documentation updates: README.md revamp, man page, and Texinfo samples
  - Note: Code audit, modernization, and test suite developed with AI assistance (Antigravity by Google DeepMind)

* 2005-09-15: Initial version 0.1.0
